[00:04.950]You and me
{"你与我"}
[00:06.660]We're infinity
{"我们是永恒"}
[00:09.690]Deep like oceans
{"深邃如海洋"}
[00:12.750]'Causewe're fireflies
{"因我们是萤火"}
[00:14.490]Glowing in the night
{"在黑夜中闪烁"}
[00:17.430]Don't stop the motion
{"别停下这律动"}
[00:21.210]And you feel just like one in a million
{"而你就是那百万里挑一"}
[00:25.260]It's so real,it's something resilient
{"如此真实　坚韧不渝"}
[00:29.250]Pull me close,there's no need for resistance
{"拥我入怀　无需抗拒"}
[00:33.270]Can you see it?
{"你能看见吗"}
[00:34.410]Afterglow
{"余晖"}
